From dfa72bb7279b05f3d95bd7eeaea555ae9ba4de79 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 17:52:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(agents): header ribbon settings in the agent's General
 tab

Adds a Header Ribbon block to the Appearance form: text (empty turns it
off), icon (preset, or upload your own image / https URL), dismissable or
always shown, background and text colour, with a live preview. Saved as
theme.ribbon in the agent's theme JSON ({text, dismissable, icon? or
icon_img?, background?, text_color?}); the agent-config API returns theme
as-is, and the widget loader maps it (synapse-sdk). Hex colours, a fixed
icon list, https-only icon URLs, and image type / 1 MB limits for uploads
are enforced on save. The upload goes to public storage like the other
theme images. No migration.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ARKEhk1KiGHfWe6vuE6FJL
